cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the dataset it produced."
title: "Code for: Nationwide 30 m maps of forest composition, biomass, and diversity in South Korea (2021–2025)"
abstract: >-
  R and Python pipeline that produces a nationwide 30 m dataset of four forest attributes for South
  Korea from Korean National Forest Inventory plots, Sentinel-2, climate, terrain and the national
  forest-type map, by direct random-forest prediction and by plot-index nearest-neighbour imputation.
